  "configuration_id": "config_010",
  "reason": "The only completed experiment is an RNA-only single-profile PCA baseline with modest accuracy (0.485) and F1 (0.464), so it is still unclear whether the image modality contains useful predictive signal. config_010 tests the simplest image-only baseline using a standard ResNet50 and single-profile input, which establishes a unimodal image reference without introducing aggregation or fusion complexity. This is the best next experiment under a limited budget because it directly reduces uncertainty about the value of the image modality before investing in more complex multimodal or multiprofile configurations, and it is directly comparable to later multimodal ResNet50 settings."
}

